{"duration": 23.03, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.62, "text": "Every boat that went out kept a log\nof each shark its crew saw. Over time,"}, {"start": 5.62, "end": 11.72, "text": "those notes became a scientific record.\nBefore 2017, the record shows only"}, {"start": 11.72, "end": 17.4, "text": "two times when a week or more passed\nwithout a great white. One gap lasted"}, {"start": 17.4, "end": 23.03, "text": "a week in 2007. The other\nlasted three weeks in 2016."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.4, "text": "Every"}, {"start": 0.4, "end": 0.72, "text": "boat"}, {"start": 0.72, "end": 0.92, "text": "that"}, {"start": 0.92, "end": 1.12, "text": "went"}, {"start": 1.12, "end": 1.4, "text": "out"}, {"start": 1.4, "end": 1.62, "text": "kept"}, {"start": 1.62, "end": 1.84, "text": "a"}, {"start": 1.84, "end": 2.14, "text": "log"}, {"start": 2.14, "end": 2.34, "text": "of"}, {"start": 2.34, "end": 2.62, "text": "each"}, {"start": 2.62, "end": 2.96, "text": "shark"}, {"start": 2.96, "end": 3.18, "text": "its"}, {"start": 3.18, "end": 3.44, "text": "crew"}, {"start": 3.44, "end": 3.84, "text": "saw."}, {"start": 4.58, "end": 4.82, "text": "Over"}, {"start": 4.82, "end": 5.32, "text": "time,"}, {"start": 5.62, "end": 6.08, "text": "those"}, {"start": 6.08, "end": 6.42, "text": "notes"}, {"start": 6.42, "end": 6.8, "text": "became"}, {"start": 6.8, "end": 7.02, "text": "a"}, {"start": 7.02, "end": 7.5, "text": "scientific"}, {"start": 7.5, "end": 8.18, "text": "record."}, {"start": 8.42, "end": 8.72, "text": "Before"}, {"start": 8.72, "end": 10.46, "text": "2017,"}, {"start": 10.46, "end": 10.68, "text": "the"}, {"start": 10.68, "end": 11.02, "text": "record"}, {"start": 11.02, "end": 11.32, "text": "shows"}, {"start": 11.32, "end": 11.72, "text": "only"}, {"start": 11.72, "end": 12.06, "text": "two"}, {"start": 12.06, "end": 12.58, "text": "times"}, {"start": 12.58, "end": 12.88, "text": "when"}, {"start": 12.88, "end": 13.0, "text": "a"}, {"start": 13.0, "end": 13